OL,3,GNEWSAMan stabbed uncle to death after  
OL,4,Arow about dog                          
OL,6,FA man who stabbed his uncle to death   
OL,7,Fafter a row about the ownership of a   
OL,8,Fdog has been found guilty of murder.   
OL,10,FDarren King, 38, received multiple stab
OL,11,Fwounds, including one to his heart, in 
OL,12,Fthe disagreement on 3 May. Many members
OL,13,Fof his family were present when he     
OL,14,Fdied.                                  
OL,16,FDonte King, 20, of Birchfield Road,    
OL,17,FWellingborough, Northamptonshire, told 
OL,18,FStoke-on-Trent Crown Court he acted in 
OL,19,Fself-defence.                          
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
